        "created_at": "2020-06-21T05:01:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If a team has 5 heroes, and an encounter generates H/2 threats (such as minions or civillians to save), do does it round up to 3 or down to 2?</p>\n<p>Or does it vary so that if H/2 occors twice you end up with a total of 5 threats?</p>\n<p>I was doing the last when running the starter module, but thought it would be good to get some clarification.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:54.918Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
